# Trivy Ignore File
# Format: CVE-ID expiry date justification
# This file documents approved CVE exceptions with business justification

# Common CVE Exceptions:
# Format: <CVE-ID> exp:YYYY-MM-DD "Justification for using vulnerable package"

# Example (keep commented out unless you have a real exception):
# AVD-AV-0001 exp:2025-12-31 "False positive - component not exposed in this context"

# Empty by default - add exceptions only with documented justification
# Include the following before each exception:
# - CVE ID and severity
# - Affected package
# - Why the vulnerability doesn't apply in our context
# - Plan to remediate or upgrade
# - Approval from security team

